 UPC that is oriented horizontally and has borders on all four sides you have [r7510344].\n\nIf you have none of these you might have [r5364985].\n\nJowcol Music [BMI]\nOriginally recorded December 9th, 1964.\nRemastered at MCA Music Studios\n\n℗ 1995 MCA Records, Inc & © 1995 GRP Records, Inc & © 1964 MCA Records, Inc\nMade in USA\nDistributed in the USA by Uni Distribution Corporation\n\nOriginal introduction written by John Coltrane, a brief essay written in 1995 by Michael Cuscuna, and the poem \"A Love Supreme\" by Coltrane printed therein.\n\nSide B total running time is 17:40\n\nCover design at Viceroy","released_formatted":"1995","identifiers":[{"type":"Barcode","value":"0 11105-0155-1 6","description":"Text"},{"type":"Barcode","value":"011105015516","description":"String"},{"type":"Rights Society","value":"BMI"},{"type":"Matrix / Runout","value":"MASTERED BY CAPITOL Wally GR-155-A F-1","description":"Side A runout"},{"type":"Matrix / Runout","value":"MASTERED BY CAPITOL Wally GR-155-B F-1","description":"Side B runout"}],"videos":[{"uri":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gta2GOqvjVE","title":"A Love Supreme, Pt. IV - Psalm","description":"Provided to YouTube by Universal Music Group\n\nA Love Supreme, Pt. IV - Psalm · John Coltrane\n\nA Love Supreme\n\n℗ 1965 UMG Recordings, Inc.\n\nReleased on: 1964-01-01\n\nProducer: George Douglas\nProducer: Bob Thiele\nProducer, Composer Lyricist: John Coltrane\nRe","duration":423,"embed":true},{"uri":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hIZFqMR1cuM","title":"A Love Supreme, Pt. II -  Resolution","description":"Provided to YouTube by Universal Music Group\n\nA Love Supreme, Pt. II -  Resolution · John Coltrane\n\nA Love Supreme\n\n℗ 1965 UMG Recordings, Inc.\n\nReleased on: 1964-01-01\n\nProducer: Bob Thiele\nProducer: George Douglas\nComposer: John Coltrane\n\nAuto-generated","duration":438,"embed":true},{"uri":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aGT7AFCTpzU","title":"A Love Supreme, Pt. III - Pursuance","description":"Provide